Imported components: nikki/files/ucode/{hijack.ut,mixin.uc,include.uc}
and nikki/files/nftables/{geoip_cn.nft,geoip6_cn.nft}.

NetFleet modifications: independent netfleet UCI/nft namespace and private
runtime paths; shared code paths under /usr/share/opl-netfleet/nikki;
load the generated runtime configuration as JSON without invoking yq.
The upstream networking rules and UCI field projections are retained.

